  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu waatsuphira anafundzie ndarira, achiamba, “Kpwahenda tajiri mmwenga ambaye muandishiwe muimirizi kala analaumiwa kpwa kuhumira mali za tajiriwe komakoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, hiye tajiri wamuiha muandishiwe achimuuza, ‘Ni maneno gani gano nisikirago? Nalonda ulavye isabu kamili ya mali na fwaida, mana kuweza kpwenderera kukala muandishi wangu.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yuya muandishi achidziuza, ‘Nihendedze mino? Tajiri wangu analonda kunifuta kazi. Nami siweza kurima, na kuvoya-voya naona haya! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambi, namanya ndivyohenda ili siku nchifutwa kazi, atu anikaribishe kpwao madzumbani.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hipho, waiha adeni a tajiriwe osi, mmwenga-mmwenga. Achimuuza yuya wa kpwandza, ‘Unaiswani ni tajiri wangu?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuya mdeni achiamba, ‘Naiswa madaba gana mwenga ga mafuha.’ Naye muandishi achimuamba, ‘Hala hino karatasiyo ya deni, sagala upesi na uandike madaba mirongo mitsano.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu achimuuza mdeni wanjina, ‘Nawe unaiswani ni tajiri wangu?’ Yuya mdeni achimuamba, ‘Naiswa magunia gana mwenga ga nganu.’ Yuya muandishi achimuamba, ‘Hala hino karatasiyo ya deni, na uandike magunia mirongo minane.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Phahi, yuya tajiri wamtogola hiye muandishi mkora kpwa vira achivyohumira achili. Sambi, hivyo ndivyo atu asiomjali Mlungu arivyo, ni erevu zaidi kushuulikiya mambo gao kuriko atu amukuluphirao Mlungu ashuulikiyavyo mambo ga Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami nakuambirani, humirani pesa chiwerevu, yani dziphahireni asena kpwa kuhumira pesa, ili siku mchifwa, Mlungu akuphokereni mlunguni, kuriko na makalo ga kare na kare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yeyesi ambaye ni muaminifu wa mambo madide, piya andakala muaminifu wa mambo makulu; na mutu ambaye si muaminifu wa mambo madide, piya kandakala muaminifu wa mambo makulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambi, ichikala tamyaaminika na mali ya duniani, ni ani ndiyekuaminini na mali ya kpweli yola Mlunguni? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kama tamyaaminika na mali ya mutu wanjina, ni ani ndiyekuphani mali ikale yenu?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
