        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.20+LUK.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.20",
              "LUK.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lazaro sikuze za kufwa ziriphofika, wafwa. Malaika achimuhala achendamuika phamwenga na Burahimu hiko mlunguni. Yuya tajiri naye, sikuze phofika, piya naye wafwa, achizikpwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuya tajiri phokala mohoni hiko kuzimu, wagaya sana. Ariphotsupha matso, wamuona Burahimu kpwa kure na Lazaro pho kanda-kanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, wamuiha Burahimu, ‘Baba Burahimu, nionera mbazi umhume Lazaro adyoge madzi na tsa ya chalache edze anireze lilimi, mana nagaya sana na huno moho!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Burahimu achimuamba, ‘Mwanangu, umanye wakati kala unasagala ko duniani waphaha mambogo manono manono, kuno Lazaro anagaya. Ela sambi iye anafurahishwa hipha, na uwe unagaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zaidi ya hivyo, kahi-kahi ya uwe na swiswi phana dibwa kulu ra ndani, ili kuzuwiya atu alondao kutsapa kula hiku kpwedza hiko, wala kusivuke mutu yeyesi kula hiko kpwedza kpwehu.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Alafu yuya tajiri achiamba, ‘Phahi, nakuvoya baba Burahimu umhume Lazaro kpwehu kaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aphiye akaaonye enehu atsano, ili nao asedze akainjira hipha mashakani.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Burahimu achimuamba, ‘Enenu ana Shariya za Musa na Maandiko ga manabii, naalunge higo.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuya tajiri achiamba, ‘Hata baba Burahimu, iyo taitosha, ela kuchiphiya mutu kula kuzimu, enehu andatubu dambi zao.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela achiambwa, ‘Ichikala enenu taandagbwira Shariya za Musa na maneno ga manabii, phahi, hata mutu achifufuka kula kuzimu taandamgbwira manenoge.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
